      "name": "clock re-push after the phone timezone changes",
      "note": "JringSyncEngine.resyncTime re-latches the offset and writes 0x01 again; the decoder then subtracts the new offset. Instants: 2023-11-14T22:13:20Z in UTC-8, then one hour later in UTC-7.",
      "context": {
        "nowMs": 1700000000000,
        "tzOffsetS": -28800
